Patient-reported outcome instruments
------------------------------------
@solvinghealth/prom works with these instruments: KOOS JR, HOOS JR, the
Oswestry Disability Index (ODI), the Neck Disability Index (NDI),
QuickDASH and PROMIS-10 Global Health. The instruments, including the
wording of their items and response options, belong to their copyright
holders. They are not covered by the Apache License, and this package
does not include their wording.

The package provides item structure, response values, scoring,
normative ranges and MCID thresholds. Obtain each instrument's wording,
and any permission or license its owner requires (commercial use often
requires one), from the owner, then load it with
registerInstrumentWording().

Scoring: KOOS JR and HOOS JR scores use a linear approximation of the
published interval-score conversion, and PROMIS-10 uses a simplified
T-score estimate instead of the official IRT-derived tables. Do not
report these as official instrument scores.
